sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as Browser
  participant Frontend as Vue 前端组件
  participant Gateway as Nginx/API 网关
  participant API as Spring Boot API
  participant CRS as CRS 章节组件
  participant DB as MySQL 数据库
  Browser->>Frontend: 章节管理页操作
  Frontend->>Gateway: POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/courses/{id}/chapters
  Gateway->>API: 反向代理 /api/v1
  API->>CRS: 调用 ChapterService
  CRS->>DB: 校验课程教师权限并读写 crs_chapter
  DB-->>CRS: 返回章节树与排序结果
  CRS-->>API: 返回章节响应
  API-->>Gateway: 统一响应
  Gateway-->>Frontend: JSON 响应
  Frontend-->>Browser: 刷新章节目录
  Browser->>Frontend: 学生读取课程章节树
  Frontend->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{id}/chapters
  Gateway->>API: 反向代理
  API->>CRS: 校验课程成员并查询章节树
  CRS-->>Browser: 返回只读章节树
